{"title":"Ectoplasm","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Wraith, Banshee</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"wraith\" title=\"Wraith - dropped it in 7 of 14 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/aeaf0aa4188ec64745fd.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wraith</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"banshee\" title=\"Banshee - dropped it in 1 of 2 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/c7ffc5d0340d5f1bcdfd.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Banshee</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"ectoplasm\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/c92b6e71974b03c38adf.svg\" alt=\"Ectoplasm\"></div><h3>Ectoplasm</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/15/2026, 9:10:12 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}